# Booster's network is not there: nothing heard, the join gives up.
@wifi nonet
@debug
say "^Press a key" 100
key x
key o
say "^WARN  Gate overridden" 100
sayn 2 "^Press a key" 300
key w
say "^Starting the radio chip" 100
say "^  Networks  0 heard, 0 hidden" 3000
say "^  Booster's network EmuMD, not heard" 100
say "^FAIL  Booster's network is not in range" 2500
say "^  EmuMD not found" 100
say "^WARN  No network was heard at all" 100
